---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
import { site } from '../data/site.js';
---
<Layout title="How it works" active="how" description="How Roots & Pantry works for families and for local food producers.">
  <div class="wrap pagehead">
    <h1>How it works</h1>
    <p class="sub">Watch the 75-second video, or read the three steps for families and three for producers below.</p>
  </div>

  <section class="block">
    <div class="wrap">
      <h2 class="sec">For families</h2>
      <figure class="film mt">
        <video controls preload="none" playsinline poster="/video/how-it-works-poster.webp" width="1920" height="1080" aria-describedby="film-cap">
          <source src="/video/how-it-works.mp4" type="video/mp4" />
          <p>Your browser can't play this video. <a href="/video/how-it-works.mp4">Download it (MP4, 14 MB)</a> or read the transcript below.</p>
        </video>
        <figcaption id="film-cap">How Roots &amp; Pantry works, told through the Hartleys, a fictional family. Captions are shown in the video. 75 seconds, with sound.</figcaption>
      </figure>
      <details class="transcript">
        <summary>Read the transcript</summary>
        <div class="prose">
          <p>The Hartley family look at the Roots &amp; Pantry app together in their kitchen.</p>
          <p><b>Voiceover:</b> Meet the Hartleys. Their family recipes all live in Roots &amp; Pantry, the free family recipe app. And when a recipe needs cheese, meat or a jar of chutney, the app shows them exclusive deals from independent producers near home.</p>
          <p>The phone shows a recipe's ingredients with local deals beside them, then a list of deals from local producers.</p>
          <p><b>Voiceover:</b> On Saturday, Nana and Priya head to the market. Helen's farmhouse cheese is 10% off for Roots &amp; Pantry families. They save money, and Helen gains new regulars.</p>
          <p>At a butcher's counter, Dave holds up his phone showing a 10% off code to show at the till.</p>
          <p><b>Voiceover:</b> Dave pops into Tom's butcher's and shows his code on his phone. Better sausages for the family, and new trade for a local shop.</p>
          <p><b>Voiceover:</b> Ruth's jams and chutneys arrive at the door, with the discount already applied to the order. She's found customers she'd never have reached on her own.</p>
          <p>Helen, Tom and Ruth share a cup of tea at the market as they pack up.</p>
          <p><b>Voiceover:</b> For local producers, it's free to list, simple to run, and it brings families to their stalls and shops, not the supermarket. And for the Hartleys? They eat well, spend less, and know exactly who made their dinner.</p>
          <p>The family share dinner with sausages, cheese and chutney. The film ends on the Roots &amp; Pantry logo.</p>
          <p><b>Voiceover:</b> Families save. Local producers grow. Roots &amp; Pantry. Free, forever.</p>
          <p class="note">The Hartleys and the producers are fictional, and the photos are AI-generated. The phone screens are from our demo, with fictional codes. Music: "Cozy Upbeat Acoustic Indie Folk" by octosound (Pixabay).</p>
        </div>
      </details>
      <ol class="steps mt">
        <li><h3>Start your family group</h3><p>Sign up with an email code, Google or Facebook. Invite the family. Parents set up simple picture logins for younger children.</p></li>
        <li><h3>Add your recipes</h3><p>Paste a link from any recipe website, type in a handwritten recipe, or share straight from your phone. Each recipe keeps a credit to where it came from.</p></li>
        <li><h3>Cook, shop and save</h3><p>Scale servings, build a shared shopping list, and see deals from local producers next to matching ingredients.</p></li>
      </ol>
      <p class="mt"><a class="btn btn-red" href={site.demo}>Try the demo family</a></p>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="block green">
    <div class="wrap">
      <h2 class="sec">For producers</h2>
      <ol class="steps">
        <li><h3>List your business free</h3><p>Add your location, contact details and where to find you: website, Facebook page, market stall or shop.</p></li>
        <li><h3>Add a deal</h3><p>At least 10% off or a free item, for at least 14 days. Online code, show-at-the-till, or both. Add your own multibuys, gift boxes and Christmas pre-orders too.</p></li>
        <li><h3>Families find you</h3><p>Your deal appears beside recipes and shopping lists that use your products, for families near you.</p></li>
      </ol>
      <p class="mt"><a class="btn btn-green" href="/for-producers/">Producer details</a></p>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="block" id="find-producers" aria-labelledby="find-h">
    <div class="wrap">
      <h2 class="sec" id="find-h">Find producers near you</h2>
      <p class="sub">Independent food and drink producers already on Roots &amp; Pantry. We're starting in Shropshire.</p>
      <form method="get" action={`${site.app}/producers`} class="panel finder">
        <div class="ffield">
          <label for="near">Your postcode or postcode district</label>
          <p class="fhint" id="near-hint">Like TF1 or TF1 2EB. We only use the first half.</p>
          <input type="text" id="near" name="near" maxlength="10" autocomplete="postal-code" aria-describedby="near-hint" required />
        </div>
        <div class="ffield">
          <label for="miles">How far?</label>
          <select id="miles" name="miles">
            {[5, 10, 15, 20, 25, 30, 35, 40, 45, 50].map((r) => <option value={r} selected={r === 25}>Within {r} miles</option>)}
          </select>
        </div>
        <button class="btn btn-green" type="submit">Find producers</button>
      </form>
      <p class="mt">Or <a href={`${site.app}/producers`}>browse by county</a>, or <a href={`${site.app}/producers/map`}>see them all on a map</a>.</p>
      {/* Seasonal: remove after Christmas (see CLAUDE.md). */}
      <p class="mt"><b>Christmas:</b> <a href={`${site.app}/producers/christmas`}>see Christmas orders and gifts from local producers</a>.</p>
    </div>
  </section>
</Layout>
